WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:05.140
Let's go over reporting a problem. Say you discovered an issue,

2
00:00:06.280 --> 00:00:09.460
or the system just wasn't working like you thought it should.

3
00:00:11.090 --> 00:00:13.190
Hit Report a problem.

4
00:00:14.590 --> 00:00:20.650
Here you can type in: I was trying to add a 736, the wrong item came up.

5
00:00:20.650 --> 00:00:22.590
I think it's a bad listing.

6
00:00:23.610 --> 00:00:31.110
Whatever you want to say here is totally fine. This will help me find the issue very quickly.

7
00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:35.490
You can also check right here if you want me to email you back.

8
00:00:36.830 --> 00:00:41.170
If you have screenshots, you can put those in here.

9
00:00:42.850 --> 00:00:49.010
You can then see exactly what you're going to send me — all of this up here, and the screenshots.

10
00:00:50.690 --> 00:00:54.570
This records all the clicks you just did.

11
00:00:55.130 --> 00:00:59.970
That helps me a lot, because it tells me what you were doing and what you were clicking,

12
00:00:59.970 --> 00:01:06.710
and points me to the right buttons to find the issue. Then just hit Send report.

13
00:01:08.010 --> 00:01:15.070
I do appreciate all the reports you send. They help make a better product for all of us. Thank you.
